      "content": "Students must select at least one emphasis within the teaching concentration and complete all requirements:Early Childhood Education & Care EmphasisElementary Education EmphasisSpecial Education/Early Intervention emphasisWhere there is a note &ldquo;Only lower division courses listed,&quot; alternative course options exist at the upper-division level. Review the University Catalog for full details.",
